        "- **Main area** — where notebooks open as tabs\n",
        "- **Kernel indicator (top-right of each notebook)** — always check it shows **\"Python (climate)\"**, not \"Python 3\" or \"base\"\n",
        "\n",
        "If the kernel is wrong, click it → select **Python (climate)** from the dropdown.\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "### Your Daily Workflow (3 Commands)\n",
        "\n",
        "After the one-time setup above, starting work every day is just:\n",
