      "source": [
        "::: {.callout-note}\n",
        "## Why `'pr'` and Not `'rain'`?\n",
        "\n",
        "Climate science tools follow the **CF Conventions** standard which uses `pr` for precipitation. Renaming now means your Notebook 2, 3, 4… code works with `xclim` and others without any changes.\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
